WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Learning records and privacy.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:10.082
The local-first LMS may retain progress, attempts, feedback, sign-off and learning-event records.

00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:17.683
Learners can export their local record and request local deletion through the privacy controls.

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:23.684
The privacy manifest declares no tracking and no collected-data categories.
